What is the rationale behind many nurses advocating complementary and alternative therapies?,"<bos><start_of_turn>user
What is the rationale behind many nurses advocating complementary and alternative therapies?<end_of_turn>
<start_of_turn>model
","There are several reasons why many nurses advocate for complementary and alternative therapies (C.A.T.):  
1. **Complementary to Traditional Methods:** Nurses often see C.A.T. as a way to supplement traditional medicine, not replace it. They may use C.A.T. to help manage side effects from traditional medications, reduce stress, or improve overall quality of life for patients.  
