","a) **Retrospective** - The study examines the smoking habits of patients who already have bladder cancer, looking backward in time to identify a possible link.  
b) **Cross-sectional** - The study records the eating habits and health status of the nurses at a single point in time.  
c) **Prospective** - The study monitors the eating and exercise patterns of the group over time to predict the likelihood of cancer development in the future.  
d) **Cross-sectional** - The study compares the prices of generic and non-generic items at a single point in time.  

