"Verify that the \(S\)-matrix satisfies the unitarity condition \(\sum_l S_{lm}^* S_{ln} = \delta_{mn}\), where \(S_{lm}\) are the matrix elements of the \(S\)-matrix.","<bos><start_of_turn>user
