Taking the natural logarithm of both sides:
\[
\ln k = \ln A - \frac{E_a}{RT}
\]
The equation can be rearranged to solve for \( E_a \):
\[
E_a = -\frac{R \ln \left( \frac{k_2}{k_1} \right)}{1/T_2 - 1/T_1}
