\[
P_W = F_{\text{fr}} \cdot v
\]  
Thus, the entropy production rate is:  
\[
\Pi_S = \frac{P_W}{T} = \frac{F_{\text{fr}} \cdot v}{T}
\]  
This represents the rate at which entropy is generated due to the irreversible frictional process.  

